          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa usaidizi wa hinya atu kumi na airi, Musa na Aruni aiha phamwenga atu osi siku ya kpwandza ya mwezi wa phiri na achiaandikisha kulengana na miryango yao na nyumba zao. Hara ariokala akafisa miaka mirongo miiri na kpwenderera aandikpwa madzina mmwenga-mmwenga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.17+NUM.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.17",
              "NUM.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "dza Mwenyezi Mlungu arivyomlagiza Musa. Naye achiaolanga hiko jangbwa ra Sinai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
