          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alume osi kula chivyazi cha Rubini yekala mwana wa mwandzo wa Iziraeli, ariokala akafisa miaka mirongo miiri na kpwenderera aambao kala anaweza kuphiya vihani, aandikpwa madzina chila mmwenga kulengana na mryangowe na nyumbaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atu arioolangbwa kula mbari ya Rubini kala ni elufu mirongo mine na sita na magana matsano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
